            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "@Cat, I just got a notice — please compile the customer satisfaction survey results into an Excel file and send it to me by next Wednesday, and don't forget to include the month-over-month data. Also, please upload the scanned copy of the contract as soon as you can. Thanks!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
