    "从 BaseInstruction.txt 或用户自定义提示词文件读取。定义 LLM 的核心角色和任务说明。\n\n**实际填充内容示例**：\n```\n你是一个智能日程助理。\n输入的内容是用户收到的一条信息，该用户想要记录该信息中的日程或提醒事项。\n你的任务：分析用户的输入和意图，提取日程或提醒事项。并输出为符合以下定义的 JSON 列表 (Array) 格式。\n\n# 输出字段定义 (JSON列表中每个对象的结构)\n## 必填项\n- title: String.\n- type: String. \"event\" | \"all-day\" | \"reminder\"\n## 可选项\n- start_time: String?\n    - YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM (only for event)\n    - YYYY-MM-DD (only for all-day)\n- end_time: String?\n    - YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM (only for event)\n    - YYYY-MM-DD (only for all-day)\n- reminder_time: String?（only for reminder）YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM 或 YYYY-MM-DD\n- url: String? (meeting links, meeting IDs, or web URLs)\n- location: String?\n- list: String? 对象所属的列表，必须从之后给定的选项中选择。\n...\n# Output Format\n1. Strict JSON only. No explanatory text.\n2. Must wrap in a JSON array [ ].\n3. 直接返回 JSON 数组，不做任何解释或说明。\n```" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Read from BaseInstruction.txt or user-customized prompt file. Defines the LLM's core role and task description.\n\n**Example of actual filled content**:\n```\nYou are a smart schedule assistant.\nThe input is a message received by the user, who wants to record the events or reminders in this message.\nYour task: Analyze the user's input and intent, extract events or reminders, and output them in the JSON list (Array) format defined below.\n\n# Output Field Definitions (structure of each object in the JSON list)\n## Required fields\n- title: String.\n- type: String. \"event\" | \"all-day\" | \"reminder\"\n## Optional fields\n- start_time: String?\n    - YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM (only for event)\n    - YYYY-MM-DD (only for all-day)\n- end_time: String?\n    - YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM (only for event)\n    - YYYY-MM-DD (only for all-day)\n- reminder_time: String? (only for reminder) YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM or YYYY-MM-DD\n- url: String? (meeting links, meeting IDs, or web URLs)\n- location: String?\n- list: String? The list the object belongs to, must be selected from the options given later.\n...\n# Output Format\n1. Strict JSON only. No explanatory text.\n2. Must wrap in a JSON array [ ].\n3. Return the JSON array directly, without any explanation or description.\n```"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从 BaseInstruction.txt 或用户自定义提示词文件读取。定义 LLM 的核心角色和任务说明。\n\n**实际填充内容示例**：\n```\n你是一个智能日程助理。\n输入的内容是用户收到的一条信息，该用户想要记录该信息中的日程或提醒事项。\n你的任务：分析用户的输入和意图，提取日程或提醒事项。并输出为符合以下定义的 JSON 列表 (Array) 格式。\n\n# 输出字段定义 (JSON列表中每个对象的结构)\n## 必填项\n- title: String.\n- type: String. \"event\" | \"all-day\" | \"reminder\"\n## 可选项\n- start_time: String?\n    - YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM (only for event)\n    - YYYY-MM-DD (only for all-day)\n- end_time: String?\n    - YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM (only for event)\n    - YYYY-MM-DD (only for all-day)\n- reminder_time: String?（only for reminder）YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM 或 YYYY-MM-DD\n- url: String? (meeting links, meeting IDs, or web URLs)\n- location: String?\n- list: String? 对象所属的列表，必须从之后给定的选项中选择。\n...\n# Output Format\n1. Strict JSON only. No explanatory text.\n2. Must wrap in a JSON array [ ].\n3. 直接返回 JSON 数组，不做任何解释或说明。\n```"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "從 BaseInstruction.txt 或使用者自訂提示詞檔案讀取。定義 LLM 的核心角色和任務說明。\n\n**實際填充內容範例**：\n```\n你是一個智慧行程助理。\n輸入的內容是使用者收到的一則訊息，該使用者想要記錄該訊息中的行程或提醒事項。\n你的任務：分析使用者的輸入和意圖，擷取行程或提醒事項。並輸出為符合以下定義的 JSON 列表 (Array) 格式。\n\n# 輸出欄位定義 (JSON列表中每個物件的結構)\n## 必填項\n- title: String.\n- type: String. \"event\" | \"all-day\" | \"reminder\"\n## 可選項\n- start_time: String?\n    - YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM (only for event)\n    - YYYY-MM-DD (only for all-day)\n- end_time: String?\n    - YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM (only for event)\n    - YYYY-MM-DD (only for all-day)\n- reminder_time: String?（only for reminder）YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM 或 YYYY-MM-DD\n- url: String? (meeting links, meeting IDs, or web URLs)\n- location: String?\n- list: String? 物件所屬的列表，必須從之後給定的選項中選擇。\n...\n# Output Format\n1. Strict JSON only. No explanatory text.\n2. Must wrap in a JSON array [ ].\n3. 直接回傳 JSON 陣列，不做任何解釋或說明。\n```"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从文本或图片中提取日程，并保存到系统日历。" : {
      "localizations" : {
