    "从日历中提取的所有唯一标签。\nLLM 从中选择合适的标签填入 `tags` 字段。\n\n**实际填充内容示例**：\n```\n[\"工作\", \"生活\", \"重要\", \"会议\"]\nSelect matching items from the list above for the 'tags' field.\nIf none match, leave it blank.\n```" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All unique tags extracted from calendars.\nThe LLM selects appropriate tags from these to fill the `tags` field.\n\n**Example of actual filled content**:\n```\n[\"Work\", \"Life\", \"Important\", \"Meeting\"]\nSelect matching items from the list above for the 'tags' field.\nIf none match, leave it blank.\n```"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从日历中提取的所有唯一标签。\nLLM 从中选择合适的标签填入 `tags` 字段。\n\n**实际填充内容示例**：\n```\n[\"工作\", \"生活\", \"重要\", \"会议\"]\nSelect matching items from the list above for the 'tags' field.\nIf none match, leave it blank.\n```"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "從行事曆中擷取的所有唯一標籤。\nLLM 從中選擇合適的標籤填入 `tags` 欄位。\n\n**實際填充內容範例**：\n```\n[\"工作\", \"生活\", \"重要\", \"會議\"]\nSelect matching items from the list above for the 'tags' field.\nIf none match, leave it blank.\n```"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以当前日期为中心的前后 15 天日期-星期映射表。帮助 LLM 将\"星期几\"、\"下周三\"等相对时间转换为准确日期。\n\n**实际填充内容示例**：\n```\n2026-05-09 星期六\n2026-05-10 星期日\n2026-05-11 星期一\n...\n2026-05-23 星期五\n2026-05-24 星期六(current request)\n2026-05-25 星期日\n...\n2026-06-08 星期一\n```" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A date-weekday mapping table for 15 days before and after the current date. Helps the LLM convert relative times like \"Monday\", \"next Wednesday\" into exact dates.\n\n**Example of actual filled content**:\n```\n2026-05-09 Saturday\n2026-05-10 Sunday\n2026-05-11 Monday\n...\n2026-05-23 Friday\n2026-05-24 Saturday(current request)\n2026-05-25 Sunday\n...\n2026-06-08 Monday\n```"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以当前日期为中心的前后 15 天日期-星期映射表。帮助 LLM 将\"星期几\"、\"下周三\"等相对时间转换为准确日期。\n\n**实际填充内容示例**：\n```\n2026-05-09 星期六\n2026-05-10 星期日\n2026-05-11 星期一\n...\n2026-05-23 星期五\n2026-05-24 星期六(current request)\n2026-05-25 星期日\n...\n2026-06-08 星期一\n```"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以當前日期為中心的前後 15 天日期-星期映射表。幫助 LLM 將「星期幾」、「下週三」等相對時間轉換為準確日期。\n\n**實際填充內容範例**：\n```\n2026-05-09 星期六\n2026-05-10 星期日\n2026-05-11 星期一\n...\n2026-05-23 星期五\n2026-05-24 星期六(current request)\n2026-05-25 星期日\n...\n2026-06-08 星期一\n```"
          }
        }
      }
    },
