    "用户授权的所有日历和提醒事项列表。\nLLM 从中选择匹配的列表名称填入 `list` 字段。\n\n**实际填充内容示例**：\n```\nCalendar Lists (for type: \"event\" or \"all-day\"):\n- \"工作\"\n- \"个人\"\n\nReminder Lists (for type: \"reminder\"):\n- \"待办\"\n- \"购物清单\"\n\nSelect a matching list from the choices above for the 'list' field. If none match, leave it blank.\n```" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All calendar and reminder lists authorized by the user.\nThe LLM selects a matching list name from these to fill the `list` field.\n\n**Example of actual filled content**:\n```\nCalendar Lists (for type: \"event\" or \"all-day\"):\n- \"Work\"\n- \"Personal\"\n\nReminder Lists (for type: \"reminder\"):\n- \"To-Do\"\n- \"Shopping List\"\n\nSelect a matching list from the choices above for the 'list' field. If none match, leave it blank.\n```"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用户授权的所有日历和提醒事项列表。\nLLM 从中选择匹配的列表名称填入 `list` 字段。\n\n**实际填充内容示例**：\n```\nCalendar Lists (for type: \"event\" or \"all-day\"):\n- \"工作\"\n- \"个人\"\n\nReminder Lists (for type: \"reminder\"):\n- \"待办\"\n- \"购物清单\"\n\nSelect a matching list from the choices above for the 'list' field. If none match, leave it blank.\n```"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用者授權的所有行事曆和提醒事項列表。\nLLM 從中選擇匹配的列表名稱填入 `list` 欄位。\n\n**實際填充內容範例**：\n```\nCalendar Lists (for type: \"event\" or \"all-day\"):\n- \"工作\"\n- \"個人\"\n\nReminder Lists (for type: \"reminder\"):\n- \"待辦\"\n- \"購物清單\"\n\nSelect a matching list from the choices above for the 'list' field. If none match, leave it blank.\n```"
          }
        }
      }
    },
